{"translation":{"id":"aii_abt","name":"ܕܝܬܩܐ ܚܕܬܐ ܕܡܪܢ ܝܫܘܥ ܡܫܝܚܐ ܘܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ ܒܠܫܢܐ ܐܬܘܪܝܐ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"ABT","englishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic NT+Psalms","language":"aii","textDirection":"rtl","sha256":"1859152dbbffe55d2b7ac6d4c09fbad5a6416ca25359e69220bb358dac602444","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/books.json","numberOfBooks":28,"totalNumberOfChapters":410,"totalNumberOfVerses":10420,"languageName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic","languageEnglishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"aii_abt","name":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","commonName":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","title":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"08b7c4463dda6adc56b2c377f42d67ace350af655720940a2e395776a718fc6c","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":93,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܒܸܥܒ݂ܵܕܵܐ ܝܠܹܗ ܡܲܠܟܘܼܬܵ‌ܐ، ܠܒ݂ܝܼܫܵܐ ܝܠܹܗ ܚܸܩܪܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܠܒ݂ܝܼܫܵܐ ܝܠܹܗ ܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܥܘܼܫܢܵܐ ܘܚܠܝܼܨܘܼܗ̇ ܝܠܹܗ ܓܵܢܹܗ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܘܼܦ ܡܘܼܩܘܝܼܬܵ‌ܐ ܝܠܵܗ̇ ܒܪܝܼܬܵ‌ܐ ܕܠܵܐ ܫܵܥܫܵܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡܘܼܩܘܝܼܵܐ ܝܠܹܗ ܟܘܼܪܣܝܘܼܟ݂ ܡ̣ܢ ܙܲܒ݂ܢܵܐ ܩܲܕܝܼܡܵܝܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡ̣ܢ ܥܵܠܲܡ ܐܲܢ݇ܬ ܝܼܘܸܬ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡܘܼܪܸܡ ܠܗܘܿܢ ܢܲܗܪ̈ܵܘܵܬܹ‌ܐ، ܝܵܐ ܡܵܪܝܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡܘܼܪܸܡ ܠܗܘܿܢ ܢܲܗܪ̈ܵܘܵܬܹ‌ܐ ܩܵܠܵܝܗ‌ܝ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡܲܪܘܼܡܹܐ ܝܢܵܐ ܢܲܗܪ̈ܵܘܵܬܹ‌ܐ ܓܲܒܓܲܒܬܵܝܗ‌ܝ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܘܼܫ ܡ̣ܢ ܩܵܠܹ̈ܐ ܕܡ̈ܝܼܵܐ ܪܵܒܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܘܼܫ ܡ̣ܢ ܠܲܦܹ̈ܐ ܙܲܪ̈ܒܵܢܹܐ ܕܝܵܡܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܙܲܪܒܵܢܵܐ ܝܠܹܗ ܒܲܡܪܵܘܡܵܐ ܡܵܪܝܵܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܣܵܗܕܘܵܬܘܼ̈ܟ݂ ܡܗܘܼܡܢܹ̈ܐ ܝܢܵܐ ܪܵܒܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܠܒܲܝܬܘܼܟ݂ ܟܹܐ ܠܵܚܡܵܐ ܩܲܕܝܼܫܘܼܬܵ‌ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܝܵܐ ܡܵܪܝܵܐ، ܠܝܘܼܪܟ݂ܵܐ ܕܝܵܘܡܵܢܹ̈ܐ.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/93.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/94.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/92.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":5}